#: src/ui/program_editor.ui:58
msgid ""
"This will record every day of the week which you select in the \"Days to run"
"\" group box."
msgstr ""
"Dit nimmt op elk Wekendag op, de binnen dat Finster »Opnehmdaag« utsöcht is."

